REM fortune.duck [MILD] - opens Notepad and types a wholesome fortune. Harmless.
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN notepad
DELAY 1800
DEFAULTDELAY 10
STRINGLN Your fortune:
ENTER
STRINGLN "The best way to predict the future is to build it in your basement lab."
ENTER
STRINGLN Lucky port: USB-C.  Lucky number: 0x1d6b.
